---
title: Swiss Meringue Buttercream
yield: 1.25 kg
---

Place the @sugar{450%g} and @egg whites{230%g} in a stainless-steel #mixer bowl{} and whisk to combine. Set the bowl over barely simmering water and heat, whisking constantly, to 74°C.

Transfer the bowl to the #mixer{} and whip with the #whip attachment{} on high speed until the meringue is the desired consistency.

Gradually add the soft @butter{570%g} (cut into medium chunks) to the meringue while whipping on high speed; the buttercream should be light and creamy. Blend in the @vanilla{10%g}.

Cover and store in the #refrigerator{} until ready to use.
